\begin{align*} x^2 - 6.5 + y^2 - 3y &= x \\ x^2 - 6.5 + 1 + y^2 - 3y + 2.25 &= x + 1 + 2.25 \\ (x^2 - 5.5)^2 + (y^2 - 1.5)^2 &= 3.75 + 2.25 \\ (x-5.5)^2 + (y-1.5)^2 &= 6 \end{align*}
<answer> Thus the radius of the cookie is $\sqrt{6}$ units. </answer>

